{"id":"8ad248c715bc0bb7","group":"28","path":"28/28-df-distributional-levin-reduction.md","title":"Levin Average-Case Reduction with Domination","display":"df-distributional-levin-reduction — Levin Average-Case Reduction with Domination","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach","book_abbrev":"28","label":"28-df-distributional-levin-reduction","aliases":["28-df-distributional-levin-reduction"],"display":"df-distributional-levin-reduction — Levin Average-Case Reduction with Domination","depends_on":["[[28-df-distributional-problem]]","[[28-df-polynomial-time-function]]"],"source_reference":"Arora–Barak, Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach, Definition 18.6","source_printed_pages":"366","source_pdf_pages":"392","source_statement_verified":true,"source_proof_reviewed":false,"verification_status":"definition-statement-checked","eligible_as_verified_dependency":true},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"28"},{"key":"label","html":"28-df-distributional-levin-reduction"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>28-df-distributional-levin-reduction</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-distributional-levin-reduction — Levin Average-Case Reduction with Domination"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"d4b3c83a7ffb542c\" href=\"?note=d4b3c83a7ffb542c\" title=\"28-df-distributional-problem\">28-df-distributional-problem</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"adb92775ec020a0b\" href=\"?note=adb92775ec020a0b\" title=\"28-df-polynomial-time-function\">28-df-polynomial-time-function</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Arora–Barak, Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach, Definition 18.6"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"366"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"392"},{"key":"source_statement_verified","html":"true"},{"key":"source_proof_reviewed","html":"false"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"definition-statement-checked"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\langle L,D\\rangle,\\langle L&#39;,D&#39;\\rangle\\in\\operatorname{DistProblem}\">\\(\\langle L,D\\rangle,\\langle L&#39;,D&#39;\\rangle\\in\\operatorname{DistProblem}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"d4b3c83a7ffb542c\" href=\"?note=d4b3c83a7ffb542c\" title=\"28-df-distributional-problem\">28-df-distributional-problem</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf{FP}\">\\(\\mathbf{FP}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"adb92775ec020a0b\" href=\"?note=adb92775ec020a0b\" title=\"28-df-polynomial-time-function\">28-df-polynomial-time-function</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p,q\\in\\mathbb N[t]\">\\(p,q\\in\\mathbb N[t]\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f:\\{0,1\\}^*\\to\\{0,1\\}^*\">\\(f:\\{0,1\\}^*\\to\\{0,1\\}^*\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D_n(x)\">\\(D_n(x)\\)</span> 为单点概率，空原像概率为0。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\langle L,D\\rangle\\le_{\\operatorname{avg}}\\langle L&#39;,D&#39;\\rangle\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\exists f\\in\\mathbf{FP}\\ \\exists p,q\\in\\mathbb N[t]\\ [\\forall x\\in\\{0,1\\}^*\\ (x\\in L\\leftrightarrow f(x)\\in L&#39;)\\land\\forall x\\in\\{0,1\\}^*\\ |f(x)|=p(|x|)\\land\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\ \\forall y\\in\\{0,1\\}^{p(n)}\\ \\sum_{x\\in\\{0,1\\}^n:f(x)=y}D_n(x)\\le q(n)D&#39;_{p(n)}(y)].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\langle L,D\\rangle\\le_{\\operatorname{avg}}\\langle L&#39;,D&#39;\\rangle\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\exists f\\in\\mathbf{FP}\\ \\exists p,q\\in\\mathbb N[t]\\ [\\forall x\\in\\{0,1\\}^*\\ (x\\in L\\leftrightarrow f(x)\\in L&#39;)\\land\\forall x\\in\\{0,1\\}^*\\ |f(x)|=p(|x|)\\land\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\ \\forall y\\in\\{0,1\\}^{p(n)}\\ \\sum_{x\\in\\{0,1\\}^n:f(x)=y}D_n(x)\\le q(n)D&#39;_{p(n)}(y)].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>保留正确性、精确长度正则性、概率支配三个条件。支配针对整个原像质量而非每个单独输入概率，故非单射归约也不会丢失聚集效应；长度函数是固定多项式。</p>\n<p>来源：Definition 18.6；印刷页 366；PDF 页 392。来源为本任务提供的605页本地PDF。</p>\n<p>R5新建理由：补足第18章的 Levin Average-Case Reduction with Domination，查重范围为本书目录的全部既有原子文件名、MOC及相邻相关定义全文；未读取其他书籍原子，全部声明依赖留在28目录。</p>\n<p>R7复核：正确性与长度条件的x量词显式限于二进制有限串，支配条件的n量词显式限于自然数；原像总质量、精确长度正则性与源书Definition18.6（PDF392）的三个条件保持一致。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"28-df-distributional-problem","status":"resolved","id":"d4b3c83a7ffb542c","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-distributional-problem]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-polynomial-time-function","status":"resolved","id":"adb92775ec020a0b","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-polynomial-time-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-distributional-problem","status":"resolved","id":"d4b3c83a7ffb542c","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\langle L,D\\rangle,\\langle L',D'\\rangle\\in\\operatorname{DistProblem}$ 见 [[28-df-distributional-problem]]；$\\mathbf{FP}$ 见 [[28-df-polynomial-time-function]]。","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-polynomial-time-function","status":"resolved","id":"adb92775ec020a0b","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\langle L,D\\rangle,\\langle L',D'\\rangle\\in\\operatorname{DistProblem}$ 见 [[28-df-distributional-problem]]；$\\mathbf{FP}$ 见 [[28-df-polynomial-time-function]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\langle L,D\\rangle,\\langle L',D'\\rangle\\in\\operatorname{DistProblem}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf{FP}","display":false},{"tex":"p,q\\in\\mathbb N[t]","display":false},{"tex":"f:\\{0,1\\}^*\\to\\{0,1\\}^*","display":false},{"tex":"D_n(x)","display":false},{"tex":"\\langle L,D\\rangle\\le_{\\operatorname{avg}}\\langle L',D'\\rangle\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\exists f\\in\\mathbf{FP}\\ \\exists p,q\\in\\mathbb N[t]\\ [\\forall x\\in\\{0,1\\}^*\\ (x\\in L\\leftrightarrow f(x)\\in L')\\land\\forall x\\in\\{0,1\\}^*\\ |f(x)|=p(|x|)\\land\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\ \\forall y\\in\\{0,1\\}^{p(n)}\\ \\sum_{x\\in\\{0,1\\}^n:f(x)=y}D_n(x)\\le q(n)D'_{p(n)}(y)].","display":true}],"bytes":2226,"backlinks":[{"id":"61dee9752dab3b61","anchor":"ref-368","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[28-df-p-computable-distribution]]、[[28-df-p-samplable-distribution]]、[[28-df-distributional-levin-reduction]]、[[28-df-distnp]]、[[28-df-distributional-bounded-halting]]、[[28-thm-levin-distnp-completeness]]。"},{"id":"c60a910dfdfc76dc","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{distNP}$ 见 [[28-df-distnp]]；$\\le_{\\operatorname{avg}}$ 见 [[28-df-distributional-levin-reduction]]；$\\operatorname{distP}$ 见 [[28-df-average-polynomial-time]]。"}],"outgoing":["d4b3c83a7ffb542c","adb92775ec020a0b"]}